{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 10, "line_no": 8, "text": "与本土语其他地区也略有不同。语音的每个音节都由声、韵、调构", "bbox_px": {"x": 184, "y": 715, "w": 1211, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "与本土语其他地区也略有不同。语音的每个音节都由声、韵、调构", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 184, "y": 715, "w": 1211, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
